# DUSKLING M2, FERN STEPS (room 2): fern steps up to the plateau, then a pink floor in front of a high rock with a pebble beetle on it: slam through the floor and go on under the rock; a fern hill and a small pit.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder.
